{"nodeId":"kp:21337","contents":[{"id":"lesson-content:book3:L069:coin-die-models","nodeId":"kp:21337","proposedNodeId":null,"kind":"example","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"均匀硬币骰子的等可能性与充分随机条件","scope":"L069具体任务及源例题；编辑组织文字，不能作为教材逐字定义。","blocks":[{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"我们在初中已经学习了可以用概率来表示某事件发生的可能性大小．等可能试验中，事件$A$的概率为：","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para25"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"$P=\\frac{\\text{发生的结果数}}{\\text{所有等可能的结果数}}$。图中旁注：这里的P是概率的英文单词Probability的第一个字母，在此表示可能性的大小。","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para26"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"下面，我们来看几个熟悉的问题：","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para27"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"[引例1]掷一枚质地均匀的硬币，观察硬币落地后哪一面朝上．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para28"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（1）会出现几个可能的结果？分别是什么？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para29"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（2）样本空间如何表示？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para30"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（3）这些结果出现的可能性是否一样？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para31"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（4）其中正面朝上的可能性是多少？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para32"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"抛掷一枚质地均匀的硬币，会出现两个可能的结果：正面朝上与反面朝上；样本空间为$\\Omega=\\{\\text{正面朝上,反面朝上}\\}$；这两个结果出现的可能性通常被认为是一样的，正面朝上的可能性即概率为$\\frac12$．这里的关键是这两个结果出现的可能性是一样的即正面朝上和反面朝上的可能性一样．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para33"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"为什么硬币正面朝上和反面朝上的可能性是一样的？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para34"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"这是由于：（1）假设抛掷的硬币是质地均匀的；（2）假设抛掷的过程是充分随机的．这两个假设使得我们确信硬币落地时不会偏向于其任何一面．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para35"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"[引例2]掷一颗质地均匀的骰子，观察出现的点数．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para36"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（1）会出现几个可能的结果？分别是什么？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para37"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（2）样本空间如何表示？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para38"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（3）这些结果出现的可能性是否一样？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para39"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（4）出现点数为1的可能性是多少？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para40"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"掷一颗质地均匀的骰子，有6个可能结果，分别是掷到点数1、2、3、4、5、6；用点数朝上来表示结果，那么样本空间是$\\Omega=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}$；这些结果出现的可能性也是一样的，因为我们认为骰子也是质地均匀的，抛掷过程充分随机．出现点数为1的可能性即概率是$\\frac16$．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para41"]}],"wordingStatus":"source_based_editorial_transcription","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"按具体内容用途匹配既有知识实体；不依赖类型标签"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para25","sourceId":"L069","sourceSha256":"13c4cfcef662f57197a375a8c985566327cd9f947ebcf62d71b1b021201aeff2","locator":{"headingPath":["12.2 古典概率（1）","均匀硬币骰子的等可能性与充分随机条件"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":25,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":2,"printedPage":2,"pdfPage":2,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"我们在初中已经学习了可以用概率来表示某事件发","wordingStatus":"source_based_editorial_transcription","wordingChecked":false,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L069","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l070-v1/evidence/L069/page-2.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L069.docx","sourceTitle":"12.2古典概率（1）-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para26","sourceId":"L069","sourceSha256":"13c4cfcef662f57197a375a8c985566327cd9f947ebcf62d71b1b021201aeff2","locator":{"headingPath":["12.2 古典概率（1）","均匀硬币骰子的等可能性与充分随机条件"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":26,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":3,"p