"quote":"（4）出现点数为1的可能性是多少？","wordingStatus":"source_based_editorial_transcription","wordingChecked":false,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L069","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l070-v1/evidence/L069/page-3.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L069.docx","sourceTitle":"12.2古典概率（1）-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book3:L069:coin-die-models:para41","sourceId":"L069","sourceSha256":"13c4cfcef662f57197a375a8c985566327cd9f947ebcf62d71b1b021201aeff2","locator":{"headingPath":["12.2 古典概率（1）","均匀硬币骰子的等可能性与充分随机条件"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":41,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":3,"printedPage":3,"pdfPage":3,"equationObjectId":null,"renderedPageEnd":4,"printedPageEnd":4,"pdfPageEnd":4},"quote":"掷一颗质地均匀的骰子，有6个可能结果，分别是","wordingStatus":"source_based_editorial_transcription","wordingChecked":false,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L069","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l070-v1/evidence/L069/page-3.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L069.docx","sourceTitle":"12.2古典概率（1）-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"}],"bodyAssets":{},"formulaRecords":[{"id":"formula:book3:L069:001","location":"blocks[0].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"我们在初中已经学习了可以用概率来表示某事件发生的可能性大小．等可能试验中，事件$A$的概率为：","latex":"A","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L069:002","location":"blocks[1].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"$P=\\frac{\\text{发生的结果数}}{\\text{所有等可能的结果数}}$。图中旁注：这里的P是概率的英文单词Probability的第一个字母，在此表示可能性的大小。","latex":"P=\\frac{\\text{发生的结果数}}{\\text{所有等可能的结果数}}","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L069:003","location":"blocks[8].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"抛掷一枚质地均匀的硬币，会出现两个可能的结果：正面朝上与反面朝上；样本空间为$\\Omega=\\{\\text{正面朝上,反面朝上}\\}$；这两个结果出现的可能性通常被认为是一样的，正面朝上的可能性即概率为$\\frac12$．这里的关键是这两个结果出现的可能性是一样的即正面朝上和反面朝上的可能性一样．","latex":"\\Omega=\\{\\text{正面朝上,反面朝上}\\}","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L069:004","location":"blocks[8].value.inlineMath[1]","sourceString":"抛掷一枚质地均匀的硬币，会出现两个可能的结果：正面朝上与反面朝上；样本空间为$\\Omega=\\{\\text{正面朝上,反面朝上}\\}$；这两个结果出现的可能性通常被认为是一样的，正面朝上的可能性即概率为$\\frac12$．这里的关键是这两个结果出现的可能性是一样的即正面朝上和反面朝上的可能性一样．","latex":"\\frac12","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L069:005","location":"blocks[16].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"掷一颗质地均匀的骰子，有6个可能结果，分别是掷到点数1、2、3、4、5、6；用点数朝上来表示结果，那么样本空间是$\\Omega=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}$；这些结果出现的可能性也是一样的，因为我们认为骰子也是质地均匀的，抛掷过程充分随机．出现点数为1的可能性即概率是$\\frac16$．","latex":"\\Omega=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}","status":"verified"},{"id":"formula:book3:L069:006","location":"blocks[16].value.inlineMath[1]","sourceString":"掷一颗质地均匀的骰子，有6个可能结果，分别是掷到点数1、2、3、4、5、6；用点数朝上来表示结果，那么样本空间是$\\Omega=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}$；这些结果出现的可能性也是一样的，因为我们认为骰子也是质地均匀的，抛掷过程充分随机．出现点数为1的可能性即概率是$\\frac16$．","latex":"\\frac16","status":"verified"}]},{"id":"lesson-content:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison","nodeId":"kp:21337","proposedNodeId":null,"kind":"contrast","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"区分两枚硬币的四结果与不区分的三结果辨析","scope":"L069具体任务及源例题；编辑组织文字，不能作为教材逐字定义。","blocks":[{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"[引例3]抛掷两枚质地均匀的硬币，观察正、反面出现的情况．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para42"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（1）会出现几个可能的结果？分别是什么？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para43"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（2）样本空间如何表示？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para44"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"（3）出现两个正面朝上的可能性是多少？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para45"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"生 老师，抛掷两枚硬币，会出现4个可能的结果，我们对两枚硬币进行区分，标上白和黑两种颜色，就可以用两个顺序的字母表示结果．例如，$HT$表示白的硬币是正面，黑的硬币是反面，会出现的结果分别是$HH,HT,TH,TT$，所以样本空间$\\Omega=\\{HH,HT,TH,TT\\}$．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para46"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"生 老师，根据上节课内容，如果不刻意区分两枚硬币，我们就只看到3个结果：两个正面，一个正面一个反面，两个反面，所以样本空间$\\Omega=\\{\\text{两正,一正一反,两反}\\}$．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para47"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"两位同学说的都很好．那么抛掷两枚硬币，出现两正的可能性为多少？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para48"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"生 根据样本空间$\\Omega=\\{HH,HT,TH,TT\\}$，出现两正即$HH$的可能性为$\\frac14$，但是为什么根据样本空间$\\Omega=\\{\\text{两正,一正一反,两反}\\}$，得到概率是$\\frac13$？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para49"]},{"role":"question","type":"text","value":"同学们，想一想，这些结果出现的可能性是否一样？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para50"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"生 老师，我知道了，样本空间$\\Omega=\\{\\text{两正,一正一反,两反}\\}$中的结果出现不等可能，所以出现两正的可能性为$\\frac13$是不对的．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para51"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"非常好．抛两枚硬币，基于生活常识，我们认为样本空间$\\Omega=\\{HH,HT,TH,TT\\}$中的每个结果出现可能性是一样的，而样本空间$\\Omega=\\{\\text{两正,一正一反,两反}\\}$中的结果出现的可能性不都一样．所以根据样本空间$\\Omega=\\{HH,HT,TH,TT\\}$，出现两个正面朝上，即$HH$的可能性为$\\frac14$．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para52"]}],"wordingStatus":"source_based_editorial_transcription","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"按具体内容用途匹配既有知识实体；不依赖类型标签"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book3:L069:two-coins-comparison:para42","sourceId":"L069","sourceSha256":"13c4cfcef662f57197a375a8c985566327cd9f947ebcf62d71b1b021201aeff2","locator":{"headingPath":["12.2 古典概率（1）","区分两枚硬币的四结果与不区分的三结果辨析"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":42,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":4,"printedPage":4,"pdfPage":4,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"[引例3]抛掷两枚质地均匀的硬币，观察正、反","wordingStatus":"source_based_editorial_transcription","wordingChecked":false,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L069","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l070-v1/evidence/L069/p